1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,020
Dexter: Do you remember when we played Catten with Bobby last Friday?

2
00:00:04,370 --> 00:00:09,890
Milo: Yeah. Technically I lost, because he built the longest road and refused to trade me a single sheep. It's a tyranny.

3
00:00:10,240 --> 00:00:14,140
Dexter: Tell me... do you not feel something... when you watch him play like that?

4
00:00:14,640 --> 00:00:18,660
Milo: Wha... what? Feel what? Like, indigestion? I did eat a lot of pretzels.

5
00:00:19,010 --> 00:00:27,390
Dexter: The way he moves the pieces... the way he builds. That long... magnificent road of his. And the way he murmurs, ore for wheat.

6
00:00:27,790 --> 00:00:30,990
Milo: I... guess? His settlement placement is, uh, statistically very good?

7
00:00:31,340 --> 00:00:35,740
Dexter: And when he rolled a seven and moved the robber? I had to leave the room.

8
00:00:36,140 --> 00:00:37,880
Milo: Dude. We were playing in your room.

9
00:00:38,230 --> 00:00:41,690
Dexter: So... do you also find him sexy when he plays Catten?
